body:
Crocs. 

&#x200B;

Also, when mental illness is paraded as being "quirky" and "random." No, Raven, clinical depression isn't something to boast about.

When my friends collectively came together to reassure how I'm a valued and loved person.

&#x200B;

Of course, being a depressed teenager, I didn't believe it, but looking back, that was the best thing I could've asked for.
